abstract: >-
  A conjecture engine and verification lab: generate mathematical objects at
  scale, screen in float, certify the survivors exactly (interval enclosures
  and exact rational decisions — a refutation here is proved). Headline
  machine-derived results archived in v2026.09: the value of lambda(4)
  (Chowla's cosine problem, finite front); a certified hot-spots domain
  beyond every analytically proven class (the second Neumann eigenfunction
  of a convex trapezoid with no symmetry axis attains its extrema on the
  boundary only, mu_1 simple in [12.020976137, 12.022398349]); and certified
  mean-field-game equilibria with more density peaks than potential wells,
  with the exact discount-free crossover 1/(8 pi^2). Every page recomputes
  its numbers from the certificates at build; planted red controls must
  fire; a build that drifts refuses to ship. Machine-derived with Claude
  (Anthropic) driving certified-arithmetic instruments; not peer-reviewed.
references:
